  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;....(i)</p><p>Replacing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;in above equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;.....(ii)</p><p>Subtraction equation (i) from equation (ii) we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is periodic with period&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now integrating both side of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;with limit&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>k</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>k</mi></math></p>"
  }
